event: thinking
data: {"id": "0cbc1bab12584033-thinking-parallel_evidence-1316", "run_id": "0cbc1bab12584033", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "I have all the necessary information from the previous calls. Let me analyze the findings:\n\n**Pod Phase & Conditions:**\n- Phase: Running\n- Initialized: True\n- Ready: False, reason=ContainersNotReady, message=\"containers with unready status: [app]\"\n- ContainersReady: False, reason=ContainersNotReady, message=\"containers with unready status: [app]\"\n- PodScheduled: True\n\n**Container Status:**\n- Container `app`: running, ready=False, restarts=0, no exitCode (no crash)\n\n**Readiness Probe:**\n- Type: h", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789390692080, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "0cbc1bab12584033-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "0cbc1bab12584033", "seq": 1317, "ts_ms": 1789390700553, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 50.51, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v16", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/0cbc1bab12584033-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "8f45c14526b293a9149e50afc5b5ecad28fbcdb9fcfb05fcbc04335b8e4f77d7", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "661a8b366d8fa7110c3d5d03c58572c04e30375ae3b6b0759b25f929c5c300bd"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "0cbc1bab12584033-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "0cbc1bab12584033", "seq": 1318, "ts_ms": 1789390700554, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "0cbc1bab12584033-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "0cbc1bab12584033", "seq": 1319, "ts_ms": 1789390709789, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.235, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1598, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v16/workload` | NotReady | Pod workload in aiops-case-v16 is NotReady (Ready=False, reason=ContainersNotReady) due to repeated readiness probe failures. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | `pod.status` (k8s) | `pod.phase: Running` | 证明 Pod 底层容器已成功启动并处于运行中状态，排除容器无法拉起的问题。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `event.message` (k8s) | `Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused` | 直接确认 kubelet 探测 18081 端口被拒绝，导致 Readiness 状态持续失败。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `pod.condition` (k8s) | `Ready: False, reason=ContainersNotReady` | 将 Event 级别的探测失败映射为 Pod 核心状态标记，确保证据链闭环。 |\n| 4 | Metric | `probe_success` (prometheus) | `0` (phase=Unknown) | 侧面印证 Pod 未能成功进入 Ready 状态。 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | `container.resources` (k8s) | `cpu: req=5m, lim=200m; mem: req=8Mi, lim=64Mi` | 确认资源配额极低且非引发“连接被拒”的原因，排除资源超限导致的服务不可用。 |\n\n当前现象（Ready=False）与事实证据高度一致：Pod 处于 Running 状态，但由于探测端口（18081）被拒绝，导致 `ContainersNotReady` 状态无法改变。Logging 与 Tracing 缺失不影响对核心端口连通性问题的判断。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nReadiness probe port (18081) ≠ Application listening port (18080) → Connection refused → ContainersNotReady → Pod status NotReady\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Readiness Probe 端口配置错误**。\n\n*   **直接证据**：Kubernetes 事件明确指出在探测 `172.16.104.33:18081/ready` 时发生 `connection refused`（证据 #2）。\n*   **机制确认**：Pod 底层已成功启动（Running，证据 #1），说明应用实际在运行且未崩溃，但应用进程监听端口（18080）与探针配置的端口（18081）不一致。\n*   **结论**：探针探测不存在的监听端口，导致 Kubelet 持续标记容器为不健康，最终 Pod 进入 `NotReady` 状态。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v16/workload` | NotReady | Pod workload in aiops-case-v16 is NotReady (Ready=False, reason=ContainersNotReady) due to repeated readiness probe failures. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | `pod.status` (k8s) | `pod.phase: Running` | 证明 Pod 底层容器已成功启动并处于运行中状态，排除容器无法拉起的问题。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `event.message` (k8s) | `Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused` | 直接确认 kubelet 探测 18081 端口被拒绝，导致 Readiness 状态持续失败。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `pod.condition` (k8s) | `Ready: False, reason=ContainersNotReady` | 将 Event 级别的探测失败映射为 Pod 核心状态标记，确保证据链闭环。 |\n| 4 | Metric | `probe_success` (prometheus) | `0` (phase=Unknown) | 侧面印证 Pod 未能成功进入 Ready 状态。 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | `container.resources` (k8s) | `cpu: req=5m, lim=200m; mem: req=8Mi, lim=64Mi` | 确认资源配额极低且非引发“连接被拒”的原因，排除资源超限导致的服务不可用。 |\n\n当前现象（Ready=False）与事实证据高度一致：Pod 处于 Running 状态，但由于探测端口（18081）被拒绝，导致 `ContainersNotReady` 状态无法改变。Logging 与 Tracing 缺失不影响对核心端口连通性问题的判断。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nReadiness probe port (18081) ≠ Application listening port (18080) → Connection refused → ContainersNotReady → Pod status NotReady\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Readiness Probe 端口配置错误**。\n\n*   **直接证据**：Kubernetes 事件明确指出在探测 `172.16.104.33:18081/ready` 时发生 `connection refused`（证据 #2）。\n*   **机制确认**：Pod 底层已成功启动（Running，证据 #1），说明应用实际在运行且未崩溃，但应用进程监听端口（18080）与探针配置的端口（18081）不一致。\n*   **结论**：探针探测不存在的监听端口，导致 Kubelet 持续标记容器为不健康，最终 Pod 进入 `NotReady` 状态。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "0cbc1bab12584033-final", "run_id": "0cbc1bab12584033", "seq": 1321, "ts_ms": 1789390709815, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v16/workload` | NotReady | Pod workload in aiops-case-v16 is NotReady (Ready=False, reason=ContainersNotReady) due to repeated readiness probe failures. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | `pod.status` (k8s) | `pod.phase: Running` | 证明 Pod 底层容器已成功启动并处于运行中状态，排除容器无法拉起的问题。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `event.message` (k8s) | `Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused` | 直接确认 kubelet 探测 18081 端口被拒绝，导致 Readiness 状态持续失败。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `pod.condition` (k8s) | `Ready: False, reason=ContainersNotReady` | 将 Event 级别的探测失败映射为 Pod 核心状态标记，确保证据链闭环。 |\n| 4 | Metric | `probe_success` (prometheus) | `0` (phase=Unknown) | 侧面印证 Pod 未能成功进入 Ready 状态。 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | `container.resources` (k8s) | `cpu: req=5m, lim=200m; mem: req=8Mi, lim=64Mi` | 确认资源配额极低且非引发“连接被拒”的原因，排除资源超限导致的服务不可用。 |\n\n当前现象（Ready=False）与事实证据高度一致：Pod 处于 Running 状态，但由于探测端口（18081）被拒绝，导致 `ContainersNotReady` 状态无法改变。Logging 与 Tracing 缺失不影响对核心端口连通性问题的判断。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nReadiness probe port (18081) ≠ Application listening port (18080) → Connection refused → ContainersNotReady → Pod status NotReady\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Readiness Probe 端口配置错误**。\n\n*   **直接证据**：Kubernetes 事件明确指出在探测 `172.16.104.33:18081/ready` 时发生 `connection refused`（证据 #2）。\n*   **机制确认**：Pod 底层已成功启动（Running，证据 #1），说明应用实际在运行且未崩溃，但应用进程监听端口（18080）与探针配置的端口（18081）不一致。\n*   **结论**：探针探测不存在的监听端口，导致 Kubelet 持续标记容器为不健康，最终 Pod 进入 `NotReady` 状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 50.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v16/workload: 50.5s (Evidence 42.1s, RCA 8.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v16/workload**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 77.569, "metrics": {"run_id": "0cbc1bab12584033", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 77.57652521133423, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 77576.52521133423, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 72083.52756500244, "tool_calls": 22, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 8, "successful_tool_calls": 21, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 14171.274900436401, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4862.113237380981}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17793.105840682983, "success": true}, "paral